#22: 
allocated structure is obviously not mapped to userspace, just copied from/to.

CHECK:ALLOC_SIZEOF_STRUCT: Prefer kmalloc(sizeof(*ptr)...) over kmalloc(sizeof(struct floppy_raw_cmd)...)
#41: FILE: drivers/block/floppy.c:3122:
+	ptr = kmalloc(sizeof(struct floppy_raw_cmd), GFP_KERNEL);

The allocation style is bad.  In general for family of
allocation functions using sizeof() to get memory size,
constructs like::

  p = alloc(sizeof(struct foo), ...)

should be::

  p = alloc(sizeof(*p), ...)

See: https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/coding-style.html#allocating-memory

